          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "section",
        "name": "Biography",
        "has_parts": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "value": "Her husband, An Cosnmhaidh Ua Dubhda, was assassinated in 1162. The Annals of Loch Ce mention her death in 1190: \"Duibhessa, daughter of Diarmaid, son of Tadhg, wife of the Cosnamhach O'Dubhda, mortua est.\"",
            "links": [
              {
                "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/An_Cosnmhaidh_Ua_Dubhda",
                "text": "An Cosnmhaidh Ua Dubhda"
              },
